Guide first-time Vendo CLI setup

Usage: vendo init [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --env <environment>  Target instance: "staging" or "prod" (default: VENDO_API_URL/profile, else prod)
      --base-url <url>     Explicit API base URL (overrides --env)
  -h, --help               Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo init
  $ vendo init --env staging
